    <statement><p>Solve the following system using augmented matrix methods:
<me>\begin{array}{c}
10 x_1 + 5 x_2  - 30 x_3 = 25
\\
-3 x_1  - 3 x_2 + 3 x_3 = -9
\\
18 x_1 + 12 x_2  - 42 x_3 = 48
\end{array}</me></p>
