</tabular>
<p>(c) Next, perform the operations</p>
<p><m>\qquad \qquad  + 3 R_1 + R_2 \to R_2</m></p>
<p><m>\qquad \qquad -18 R_1 + R_3 \to R_3</m>.</p>
